Attribution
-----------

coverdb.csv is a derivative work of the Nintendo 64 DAT files published by
the libretro-database project, which are licensed CC BY-SA 4.0:

    https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database

The cartridge header CRCs, NUS product codes, release names, genres,
publishers, years, player counts and region flags were extracted from those
DATs by tools/seed_coverdb.py and reshaped into this project's schema.
Corrections applied by hand through tools/curate.py (art overrides and genre
fixes) are contributed to the same file under the same licence.

genres.csv is an original mapping written for this project from the genre
vocabulary used by those DATs onto a smaller display vocabulary. It is
offered under the same licence so the two files travel together.


Why this directory is licensed separately
-----------------------------------------

The rest of SleekMenu 64 is licensed AGPL-3.0-only (see ../LICENSE).
CC BY-SA 4.0 is a share-alike licence, and Creative Commons has declared
exactly two outside licences ShareAlike-compatible with version 4.0: the
Free Art License 1.3 and GPLv3. AGPLv3 is not among them.

Rather than assert a compatibility nobody has declared, these files keep
their upstream licence. They are data read at build time by the host-side
tooling; they are not linked into the ROM. If you redistribute them, keep
this notice and the attribution above with them.


What is NOT here
----------------

No box art. Cover images are the copyright of their respective publishers
and are not redistributable, so none ship with this project -- not in the
repository, not in a release, and not inside the prep tool. The tool fetches
them to the user's own card from libretro-thumbnails at the user's request.
See the README.
